  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Framework Contract for Procurement of Technical Service for Decentralization of DRM-NDRMC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This Technical Service FWC aims to support the &#xbf;Decentralization of Disaster Risk Management in Federal DRMC and the five Regional States (Afar, Central Ethiopia, Southern Ethiopia, Southwest Ethiopia and Tigray) so as to contribute to the realization of the DRM policy (2013) and the 2014 SPIF strategy of the Ethiopian Government.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
